{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id10365337"}, "name":{"label":"Bloody Life 💔"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-18T16:42:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14199218234"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing, completely worth the money"}, "content":{"label":"I LOVE this game, there are so many things you can do, with no in-app purchases, or ads! I also like how you are able to start your own family, and even date the same gender (happy pride month!). You could also start your own farms and raise Chickens, Ducks, Goats, Cows, and ride your very own horse, all at the cost of some hard work and perseverance. I genuinely love this game so much and am very grateful that the devs put so much pixel art into it (I love the pixel art) and making it with so much love. Also you can Raise dinosaurs, just found that out.🦖", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
