{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1933026129"}, "name":{"label":"crosspumpkin"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-14T13:40:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14183148211"}, "title":{"label":"Poor UI"}, "content":{"label":"The game is great, but I can’t see the Energy Bar after about halfway, which is incredibly important if I’m out and about. It gets cut off of the screen in the corner and there’s no padding option for it. Also, the controls and buttons are completely invisible unless you want really tiny visible buttons. I prefer to have an invisible left stick and then 2 resizable and placeable buttons on the right but that’s just not possible and makes it very difficult to play. \n\nThe energy bar being cut off has apparently been a long standing issue according to forums online going as far back as 2 years which is very unfortunate. But as great of a game that this is, not being able to easily see my energy makes it unplayable for me.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
