{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id203025614"}, "name":{"label":"Mel15768"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-11T13:23:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14171293218"}, "title":{"label":"Game too zoomed, can’t play"}, "content":{"label":"I was excited to play Stardew Valley but unfortunately I can’t use it on my phone at all. The edges of the screen are too zoomed in and there’s no way to fix it as I can’t access the in-game settings. From looking online this seems to be a problem for others as well so I wish the developers would get it sorted.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1521226771"}, "name":{"label":"My Ai Is Horrible"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-10T18:01:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14168096556"}, "title":{"label":"Mobile HUD optimisation needed"}, "content":{"label":"Stardew valley is fantastic as a game. Anyone who hasn’t played it should give it a try. My issue is with the  HUD when playing on the iPhone. The bottom of the energy bar is off screen so I am unsure of when I am actually going to run out of energy causing me to either spend extra money on food or end days early because I don’t know how much energy I have.  The hotbar also is blocked by the dynamic island on iPhone so you are required to add a large buffer that cuts off a large part of the screen in order to even use half of the hotbar while using touch screen controls. If there were more options to customise where the hotbar is located on the screen as well as being able to move the energy and money bars on the HUD that would immediately solve all of my issues with the mobile version of the game. Aside from HUD incompatibility this is a fantastic game and I would recommend it to anyone. It’s so great that I have bought it on three seperate platforms. Please fix the HUD issues on mobile.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"10"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"11"}}, 
