{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1254151875"}, "name":{"label":"Turtle leader 🐢"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-25T12:32:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14105530545"}, "title":{"label":"Not too awesome"}, "content":{"label":"It’s a very immersive game. You can have a partner, customize your farm and the town, and participate in events that have awards. However, the game can get extremely repetitive, even if you’re doing the task to get something. For the majority of quests or things you need to achieve something, the cycle below is what your gonna do:\n\nBuy seeds, sow seeds, water seeds, sleep, repeat\n\nAnd sure, you can do other things in the day. But for what reason? Quests come very slow with little reward. Also, you can just delete every quest you get and finish the game with no effort. Also,\n\nIt’s very, very, very grindy. A lot of things cost multiple steps (and money) to do. Such as getting a partner, you need to buy a bigger house, buy a bouquet, get about 20,000G. And to get those 20,000G, it’s either you ALSO grind for it by fishing or something else OR grinding AGAIN for a better farm, and then after that you grind IN that farm for the money. And THEN you pay to fix the bridge for the beach, which you also have to GRIND wood. Once you fix it, you spend the money on the necklace thingy that costs 10,000G or something. \n\nReally, it’s heavily on money to make you progress in the game. Unlike Wylde flowers. You can be poor all you want but you can still progress in the game easily. ):< Be more like Wylde flowers.\n\n2 stars. Not pleased.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id517981504"}, "name":{"label":"Javsbdjdb"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-24T18:12:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6.15.1"}, "id":{"label":"14102614885"}, "title":{"label":"Waste of money"}, "content":{"label":"Bought this for my iphone, and immediately upon playing I accidentally hit the fish smoker in my house with the pick ax, which placed it in my inventory. There seems to be no way to place it back in the room. When I drop the fish smoker it just bounces on the floor and back into my inventory. I also accidentally picked up the boat on the table and cannot place it back in on the table.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1406710800&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
